# AUTO-GENERATED by Claude Code
# Purpose: every keyboard shortcut of delulu-smash, named by what it does
#          (Shortcut.FULL_SCREEN). The one place keys are set: the help panel, button tooltips,
#          the cell editor's keymap, the keybindings list (Alt+K) and assets/panes.js / keys.js
